---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'August 25, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How USAPrizes.com collects, uses, and protects information from visitors, including analytics and cookies."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy-policy/' }]} />
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        USAPrizes.com does not require account creation and does not knowingly collect
        sensitive personal information directly. When you visit the site, we and our analytics
        providers may automatically collect standard technical information, including your IP
        address, browser type, device type, pages viewed, and referring page.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics 4 and Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate traffic
        and improve the site. These tools may use cookies or similar technologies. You can
        opt out of Google Analytics tracking using <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener">Google's browser opt-out tool</a>. Cloudflare Web Analytics does not use cookies or collect personal identifiers.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site may use essential cookies for basic functionality and non-essential cookies
        for analytics, as described above. You can control or disable cookies through your
        browser settings; disabling them may affect some site functionality.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        This site links to third-party sweepstakes casino operators, some via affiliate links
        (see our <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a>). We are not responsible for
        the privacy practices of any third-party site you visit from a link on this site. Review
        their privacy policies directly.
      </p>

      <h2>Data we do not sell</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal information to third parties. Where required by applicable state
        privacy law (for example, California's CCPA/CPRA), you may have the right to request
        access to, deletion of, or an opt-out of certain processing of information we hold about
        you; contact us via the details on our <a href="/about/">About</a> page to make a
        request.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed at children and we do not knowingly collect information from
        anyone under the age described in our <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected
        by an updated "Last updated" date at the top of this page.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: contact details are published on our <a href="/about/">About</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
